-โปรตุกีส/ชิโน-ตะกั่วป่าที่สัมพันธ์กับยุคเหมืองแร่ดีบุก\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"มีจุดเด่นอะไรให้ชม\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"อาคารบ้านเรือนและตึกแถวชิโน-โปรตุกีสในย่านเมืองเก่า อาหารพื้นเมือง ขนมพื้นบ้าน และของกินท้องถิ่น การแสดงศิลปวัฒนธรรม การละเล่นพื้นเมือง และการแต่งกายแบบบาบ๋า\"}}]}]": "[{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://takuapa101.pages.dev/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Takua Pa Old Town Cultural Street\", \"item\": \"https://takuapa101.pages.dev/places/culture-street/\"}]}, {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"TouristAttraction\", \"name\": \"Takua Pa Old Town Cultural Street\", \"url\": \"https://takuapa101.pages.dev/places/culture-street/\", \"image\": \"https://takuapa101.pages.dev/assets/culture-street.webp\", \"description\": \"A walking-street district linking old buildings, food, and local life\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Thanon Si Takua Pa and Thanon Udom Thara\", \"addressLocality\": \"Takua Pa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Phang Nga\", \"addressCountry\": \"TH\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 8.829848, \"longitude\": 98.364073}, \"telephone\": \"076424279\", \"openingHoursSpecification\": [{\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": \"https://schema.org/Sunday\", \"opens\": \"14:00\", \"closes\": \"20:00\"}]}, {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What time is it open?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sunday 14:00·20:00\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there an admission fee?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Not verified · Free admission\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I get there from Takua Pa town?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Take Thanon Rat Bamrung into the old town, then continue along Thanon Si Takua Pa; the walking street is around Thanon Si Takua Pa and Thanon Udom Thara\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the history of this place?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Buildings in the old town preserve traces of Sino-Portuguese and Sino-Takua Pa architecture associated with the tin-mining era\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is there to see?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sino-Portuguese houses and shophouses in the old town, local dishes, traditional snacks and local food, cultural performances, local games, and Baba-style clothing\"}}]}]"
